  "prompt_mode": "chat_continuation",
  "prompt_text": "Continue the given text:\nYour entire life, you've been told you're deathly allergic to bees. You've always had people protecting you from them, be it your mother or a hired hand. Today, one slips through and lands on your shoulder. You hear a tiny voice say \"Your Majesty, what are your orders?\"\n\nYou freeze.",
  "reference_single_token_nfa_states": 20,
  "reference_text": "\n\nWhat?\n\n\"Your Majesty, what are your orders?\"\n\nYou know that voice came from the bee, even if you don't want to believe it. It can't be true.\n\n\"Is this real?\"\n\nYou ask that to yourself, but the bee responds, \"Of course it is.\"",
